---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout 
  title="使用教程 - 全平台客户端配置指南" 
  description="为您提供最新、最全的翻墙机场使用教程，涵盖 Windows, macOS, iOS, Android 等全平台主流客户端的配置与使用方法。"
>
  <div class="page-shell guide-page">
    <header class="guide-header">
      <h1>🚀 新手使用与配置教程</h1>
      <p>无论您使用的是电脑、手机还是路由器，在这里您都能找到最详尽的图文配置指南，助您轻松连接，畅游世界。</p>
    </header>

    <!-- 全平台主流客户端配置 -->
    <section class="tutorial-section">
      <div class="section-title-wrap">
        <h2 class="section-title">全平台主流客户端配置</h2>
        <p class="section-subtitle">适合刚买完机场套餐，需要把订阅节点导入到手机或电脑客户端的用户。</p>
      </div>

      <div class="tutorial-grid">
        <!-- Card 1: Clash Verge Rev -->
        <div class="tutorial-card">
          <div class="tc-top">
            <div class="tc-icon pc-icon">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="2" y="3" width="20" height="14" rx="2" ry="2"></rect><line x1="8" y1="21" x2="16" y2="21"></line><line x1="12" y1="17" x2="12" y2="21"></line></svg>
            </div>
            <div class="tc-meta">
              <span class="tc-platform">Windows / macOS</span>
              <span class="tc-level">入门</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="tc-body">
            <h3>Clash Verge Rev 使用教程</h3>
            <p>Clash Verge Rev 是 Windows 和 macOS 用户最常用的代理客户端。内核强大，界面现代化。本教程适合导入机场订阅、选择节点、开启规则模式并测试节点延迟。</p>
          </div>
          <a href="/guide/clash-verge-rev/" class="tc-btn">
            查看教程
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"></line><polyline points="12 5 19 12 12 19"></polyline></svg>
          </a>
        </div>
        <!-- Card 2: Shadowrocket -->
        <div class="tutorial-card">
          <div class="tc-top">
            <div class="tc-icon ios-icon">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="5" y="2" width="14" height="20" rx="2" ry="2"></rect><line x1="12" y1="18" x2="12.01" y2="18"></line></svg>
            </div>
            <div class="tc-meta">
              <span class="tc-platform">iPhone / iPad</span>
              <span class="tc-level">入门</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="tc-body">
            <h3>Shadowrocket 小火箭教程</h3>
            <p>Shadowrocket 是 iOS 苹果用户最常见、最好用的代理客户端。支持所有主流协议。本教程将教您如何配置订阅、开启代理并排查无法连接的问题。</p>
          </div>
          <a href="/guide/shadowrocket/" class="tc-btn">
            查看教程
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"></line><polyline points="12 5 19 12 12 19"></polyline></svg>
          </a>
        </div>
        <!-- Card 3: Android -->
        <div class="tutorial-card">
          <div class="tc-top">
            <div class="tc-icon android-icon">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="5" y="2" width="14" height="20" rx="2" ry="2"></rect><path d="M12 18h.01"></path></svg>
            </div>
            <div class="tc-meta">
              <span class="tc-platform">Android 安卓手机</span>
              <span class="tc-level">入门</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="tc-body">
            <h3>v2rayNG / Clash 教程</h3>
            <p>安卓手机最主流的翻墙软件。本教程教您如何安全下载官方包，解决订阅解析失败，以及如何优化后台常驻解决锁屏断网问题。</p>
          </div>
          <a href="/guide/clash-for-android/" class="tc-btn">
            查看教程
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"></line><polyline points="12 5 19 12 12 19"></polyline></svg>
          </a>
        </div>
        <!-- Card 4: macOS -->
        <div class="tutorial-card">
          <div class="tc-top">
            <div class="tc-icon pc-icon">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M22 12H2"></path><path d="M5.45 5.11 2 12v6a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h16a2 2 0 0 0 2-2v-6l-3.45-6.89A2 2 0 0 0 16.76 4H7.24a2 2 0 0 0-1.79 1.11z"></path></svg>
            </div>
            <div class="tc-meta">
              <span class="tc-platform">macOS 苹果电脑</span>
              <span class="tc-level">入门/进阶</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="tc-body">
            <h3>Mac 科学上网工具教程</h3>
            <p>包含 Clash Verge Rev 与 Surge for Mac。详解 M 芯片与 Intel 芯片版本差异、如何一键导入订阅，以及开启增强模式 (Tun Mode) 解决无法联网的问题。</p>
          </div>
          <a href="/guide/mac/" class="tc-btn">
            查看教程
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"></line><polyline points="12 5 19 12 12 19"></polyline></svg>
          </a>
        </div>
        <!-- Card 5: Sing-box -->
        <div class="tutorial-card">
          <div class="tc-top">
            <div class="tc-icon router-icon">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polygon points="12 2 2 7 12 12 22 7 12 2"></polygon><polyline points="2 17 12 22 22 17"></polyline><polyline points="2 12 12 17 22 12"></polyline></svg>
            </div>
            <div class="tc-meta">
              <span class="tc-platform">全平台客户端</span>
              <span class="tc-level tc-advanced">前沿</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="tc-body">
            <h3>Sing-box 教程配置指南</h3>
            <p>新一代通用代理工具。完美支持 Hysteria 2 与 TUIC 等新兴协议，资源占用极低。本教程教您如何在各平台图形化客户端 (GUI) 中配置 Sing-box 节点。</p>
          </div>
          <a href="/guide/sing-box/" class="tc-btn">
            查看教程
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"></line><polyline points="12 5 19 12 12 19"></polyline></svg>
          </a>
        </div>
        <!-- 用户之后将在这里添加其他板块 -->
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- 排错与疑难杂症 -->
    <section class="tutorial-section" style="margin-top: 60px;">
      <div class="section-title-wrap" style="border-left-color: #f59e0b;">
        <h2 class="section-title">排错与疑难杂症</h2>
        <p class="section-subtitle">遇到节点超时、软件打不开、或者网速慢？在这里寻找专门的排查解决方案。</p>
      </div>

      <div class="tutorial-grid">
        <!-- Card: Troubleshooting No Internet -->
        <div class="tutorial-card">
          <div class="tc-top">
            <div class="tc-icon" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ef4444, #f97316); box-shadow: 0 6px 16px rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.3);">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" style="width:24px; height:24px; color:#fff;"><path d="M10.29 3.86L1.82 18a2 2 0 0 0 1.71 3h16.94a2 2 0 0 0 1.71-3L13.71 3.86a2 2 0 0 0-3.42 0z"></path><line x1="12" y1="9" x2="12" y2="13"></line><line x1="12" y1="17" x2="12.01" y2="17"></line></svg>
            </div>
            <div class="tc-meta">
              <span class="tc-platform">全平台故障排查</span>
              <span class="tc-level" style="color: #ef4444; background: #fef2f2;">常见报错</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="tc-body">
            <h3>代理连接成功打不开网页？</h3>
            <p>测速全绿有延迟，但连不上外网？一文教您排查系统时间、DNS 污染、浏览器插件以及 TUN 模式网卡冲突，告别假连通。</p>
          </div>
          <a href="/guide/troubleshooting-no-internet/" class="tc-btn">
            查看解决方案
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"></line><polyline points="12 5 19 12 12 19"></polyline></svg>
          </a>
        </div>
        <!-- Card: Routing Mode -->
        <div class="tutorial-card">
          <div class="tc-top">
            <div class="tc-icon" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #10b981, #0ea5e9); box-shadow: 0 6px 16px rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.3);">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" style="width:24px; height:24px; color:#fff;"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><line x1="12" y1="8" x2="12" y2="12"></line><line x1="12" y1="16" x2="12.01" y2="16"></line></svg>
            </div>
            <div class="tc-meta">
              <span class="tc-platform">全平台故障排查</span>
              <span class="tc-level" style="color: #10b981; background: #ecfdf5;">基础概念</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="tc-body">
            <h3>规则、全局与直连模式的区别</h3>
            <p>挂了代理后微信收不到消息？国内网站奇慢无比？带您彻底弄懂客户端三大路由模式 (Rule/Global/Direct) 的本质区别，防止流量浪费。</p>
          </div>
          <a href="/guide/troubleshooting-routing-mode/" class="tc-btn">
            查看解决方案
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"></line><polyline points="12 5 19 12 12 19"></polyline></svg>
          </a>
        </div>
        <!-- Card: LAN Proxy Share -->
        <div class="tutorial-card">
          <div class="tc-top">
            <div class="tc-icon" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #8b5cf6, #3b82f6); box-shadow: 0 6px 16px rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.3);">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" style="width:24px; height:24px; color:#fff;"><rect x="2" y="7" width="20" height="15" rx="2" ry="2"></rect><polyline points="17 2 12 7 7 2"></polyline></svg>
            </div>
            <div class="tc-meta">
              <span class="tc-platform">主机与电视盒子</span>
              <span class="tc-level" style="color: #8b5cf6; background: #f5f3ff;">进阶玩法</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="tc-body">
            <h3>局域网代理共享 (Switch/PS5)</h3>
            <p>电视盒子看 Netflix 锁区？Switch 下载慢、PS5 联机 NAT 报错？教您如何通过开启电脑的“允许局域网连接”功能，让全家设备共享翻墙网络。</p>
          </div>
          <a href="/guide/troubleshooting-lan-proxy/" class="tc-btn">
            查看解决方案
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"></line><polyline points="12 5 19 12 12 19"></polyline></svg>
          </a>
        </div>
        <!-- 用户之后将在这里添加排错相关的板块 -->
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- 热门高频应用场景 -->
    <section class="tutorial-section" style="margin-top: 60px;">
      <div class="section-title-wrap" style="border-left-color: #ec4899;">
        <h2 class="section-title">热门高频应用场景</h2>
        <p class="section-subtitle">解锁 ChatGPT、观看 4K 流媒体、跨境电商运营？为您提供专属的场景落地指南。</p>
      </div>

      <div class="tutorial-grid">
        <!-- Card: AI Unblock -->
        <div class="tutorial-card">
          <div class="tc-top">
            <div class="tc-icon" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ec4899, #8b5cf6); box-shadow: 0 6px 16px rgba(236, 72, 153, 0.3);">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" style="width:24px; height:24px; color:#fff;"><path d="M9.937 15.5A2 2 0 0 0 8.5 14.063l-6.135-1.582a.5.5 0 0 1 0-.962L8.5 9.936A2 2 0 0 0 9.937 8.5l1.582-6.135a.5.5 0 0 1 .963 0L14.063 8.5A2 2 0 0 0 15.5 9.937l6.135 1.581a.5.5 0 0 1 0 .964L15.5 14.063a2 2 0 0 0-1.437 1.437l-1.582 6.135a.5.5 0 0 1-.963 0z"></path></svg>
            </div>
            <div class="tc-meta">
              <span class="tc-platform">AI 工具库解锁</span>
              <span class="tc-level" style="color: #db2777; background: #fce7f3;">高频需求</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="tc-body">
            <h3>ChatGPT / Claude 解锁防封</h3>
            <p>遇到 ChatGPT 提示 Access Denied 或 Claude 注册报错被封号？带您彻底弄懂数据中心 IP 与原生住宅 IP 的区别，以及如何伪装指纹防封号。</p>
          </div>
          <a href="/guide/scenario-ai-unblock/" class="tc-btn">
            查看解决方案
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"></line><polyline points="12 5 19 12 12 19"></polyline></svg>
          </a>
        </div>
        <!-- Card: Streaming Unblock -->
        <div class="tutorial-card">
          <div class="tc-top">
            <div class="tc-icon" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #e11d48, #f43f5e); box-shadow: 0 6px 16px rgba(225, 29, 72, 0.3);">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" style="width:24px; height:24px; color:#fff;"><polygon points="5 3 19 12 5 21 5 3"></polygon></svg>
            </div>
            <div class="tc-meta">
              <span class="tc-platform">影视流媒体跨区</span>
              <span class="tc-level" style="color: #e11d48; background: #ffe4e6;">高频需求</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="tc-body">
            <h3>Netflix / Disney+ 解锁与跨区</h3>
            <p>看奈飞提示使用代理？Disney+ 一直转圈？带您了解流媒体 IP 版权检测机制，教您如何挑选原生解锁节点，并解决 YouTube Premium 锁区问题。</p>
          </div>
          <a href="/guide/scenario-streaming-unblock/" class="tc-btn">
            查看解决方案
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"></line><polyline points="12 5 19 12 12 19"></polyline></svg>
          </a>
        </div>
        <!-- Card: Telegram Proxy -->
        <div class="tutorial-card">
          <div class="tc-top">
            <div class="tc-icon" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0ea5e9, #3b82f6); box-shadow: 0 6px 16px rgba(14, 165, 233, 0.3);">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" style="width:24px; height:24px; color:#fff;"><line x1="22" y1="2" x2="11" y2="13"></line><polygon points="22 2 15 22 11 13 2 9 22 2"></polygon></svg>
            </div>
            <div class="tc-meta">
              <span class="tc-platform">即时通讯社交</span>
              <span class="tc-level" style="color: #0ea5e9; background: #f0f9ff;">新手必看</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="tc-body">
            <h3>Telegram (电报) 设置指南</h3>
            <p>翻墙后还是连不上电报？收不到短信验证码？带您避开钓鱼假软件，一键安装 Telegram 官方汉化包，并配置专属的 SOCKS5 代理网络。</p>
          </div>
          <a href="/guide/scenario-telegram/" class="tc-btn">
            查看解决方案
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"></line><polyline points="12 5 19 12 12 19"></polyline></svg>
          </a>
        </div>
        <!-- 用户之后将在这里添加场景相关的板块 -->
      </div>
    </section>

  </div>

  <style is:inline>
    .guide-page {
      padding-top: 60px;
      padding-bottom: 100px;
      background-color: #f8fafc;
      min-height: 100vh;
    }
    
    .guide-header {
      text-align: center;
      margin-bottom: 70px;
    }
    .guide-header h1 {
      font-size: 2.8rem;
      color: var(--ink);
      margin-bottom: 18px;
      font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: -0.5px;
    }
    .guide-header p {
      font-size: 1.15rem;
      color: var(--muted);
      max-width: 650px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      line-height: 1.7;
    }

    .tutorial-section {
      max-width: 1200px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 0 20px;
    }

    .section-title-wrap {
      margin-bottom: 50px;
      border-left: 6px solid #3b82f6;
      padding-left: 20px;
    }
    .section-title {
      font-size: 2rem;
      color: #0f172a;
      font-weight: 800;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }
    .section-subtitle {
      font-size: 1.05rem;
      color: #64748b;
    }

    .tutorial-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(340px, 1fr));
      gap: 30px;
    }

    .tutorial-card {
      background: #ffffff;
      border: 1px solid rgba(226, 232, 240, 0.8);
      border-radius: 20px;
      padding: 32px 28px;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.03);
      transition: all 0.4s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      position: relative;
    }
    .tutorial-card:hover {
      transform: translateY(-8px);
      box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.08);
      border-color: rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.2);
    }

    .tc-top {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 16px;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
    }

    .tc-icon {
      width: 52px;
      height: 52px;
      border-radius: 14px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      color: #ffffff;
    }
    .tc-icon svg {
      width: 24px;
      height: 24px;
    }
    .pc-icon { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #6366f1, #8b5cf6); box-shadow: 0 6px 16px rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.3); }
    .ios-icon { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f43f5e, #fb923c); box-shadow: 0 6px 16px rgba(244, 63, 94, 0.3); }
    .win-icon { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0ea5e9, #3b82f6); box-shadow: 0 6px 16px rgba(14, 165, 233, 0.3); }
    .android-icon { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #10b981, #3b82f6); box-shadow: 0 6px 16px rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.3); }
    .router-icon { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f59e0b, #ef4444); box-shadow: 0 6px 16px rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.3); }

    .tc-meta {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 4px;
    }
    .tc-platform {
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: #475569;
    }
    .tc-level {
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      color: #10b981;
      background: #ecfdf5;
      padding: 2px 8px;
      border-radius: 6px;
      align-self: flex-start;
      font-weight: 600;
    }
    .tc-advanced {
      color: #f59e0b;
      background: #fffbeb;
    }

    .tc-body {
      flex-grow: 1;
      margin-bottom: 30px;
    }
    .tc-body h3 {
      font-size: 1.4rem;
      color: #0f172a;
      margin: 0 0 12px 0;
      font-weight: 800;
    }
    .tc-body p {
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      color: #64748b;
      line-height: 1.6;
      margin: 0;
    }

    .tc-btn {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 8px;
      background: #f1f5f9;
